## PROJECT 01 — RNA-seq Quality Control with FastQC & MultiQC

### `projects/project_01_rnaseq_qc/README.md`

---

**🎯 Objective**

Perform quality control on publicly available RNA-seq FASTQ files to assess read quality, adapter contamination, per-base sequence quality, GC content distribution, and sequence duplication levels.

**⚠️ Skill Level:** Beginner-Intermediate | ~1 year learning | Part of self-directed portfolio

